   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.88,
    "text": "I believed that if I was thin,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 2.88,
    "end": 6.56,
    "text": "if I weighed this magical number on the scale,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 6.56,
    "end": 9.6,
    "text": "then I was strong, then I was free,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 9.6,
    "end": 12.92,
    "text": "then I was worthy of love, but I had a crisis."
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 12.92,
    "end": 15.68,
    "text": "See, I was engaged to get married,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 15.68,
    "end": 20.68,
    "text": "and I got so depressed that I outgrew the wedding dress."
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 20.96,
    "end": 24.32,
    "text": "I had bought a wedding dress in the hope"
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 24.32,
    "end": 28.04,
    "text": "that I would be able to lose enough weight to wear it,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 28.04,
    "end": 30.6,
    "text": "But instead, I gained so much weight,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 30.6,
    "end": 32.88,
    "text": "they couldn't even zip it up."
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 32.88,
    "end": 35.4,
    "text": "I remember falling on my face and saying,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t12",
    "start": 35.4,
    "end": 38.68,
    "text": "God, now that I've become a Christian, I am fat."
   },
   {
    "id": "t13",
    "start": 38.68,
    "end": 40.0,
    "text": "Like it was his fault."
   },
   {
    "id": "t14",
    "start": 40.0,
    "end": 41.48,
    "text": "He was like, I didn't make you eat"
   },
   {
    "id": "t15",
    "start": 41.48,
    "end": 43.76,
    "text": "that whole row of chocolate chip cookie dough."
   },
   {
    "id": "t16",
    "start": 43.76,
    "end": 48.04,
    "text": "I didn't make you eat that Domino's Pizza by yourself."
   },
   {
    "id": "t17",
    "start": 48.04,
    "end": 50.08,
    "text": "Listen, he said, you have an idol."
   },
   {
    "id": "t18",
    "start": 50.08,
    "end": 51.36,
    "text": "And he said, give this to me."
   },
   {
    "id": "t19",
    "start": 51.36,
    "end": 53.64,
    "text": "I remember thinking, but that's a carnal thing."
   },
   {
    "id": "t20",
    "start": 53.64,
    "end": 54.48,
    "text": "It's the carnal thing."
   },
   {
    "id": "t21",
    "start": 54.48,
    "end": 59.44,
    "text": "He said, anything that has control over you is a concern for me."
   }
